high pressure system, you know!

03:29.062 --> 03:31.656
Sis, you idiot...

03:33.700 --> 03:35.268
I'm sorry about this, everyone.

03:35.268 --> 03:38.371
Even all the pastries in the cafeteria
were sold out.

03:38.371 --> 03:39.339
Don't worry about it.

03:39.339 --> 03:43.810
