04:26.386 --> 04:30.190
Oh yeah, you work at a Chinese restaurant!

04:30.190 --> 04:31.491
Must be nice!

04:31.491 --> 04:36.396
No, I just went in the kitchen while they were
preparing food and made it for myself.

04:36.930 --> 04:36.963
WOW!

04:36.963 --> 04:38.098
WOW!

04:38.098 --> 04:38.598
WOW!

04:38.598 --> 04:39.900
