04:53.146 --> 04:54.080
Hmm?

04:54.080 --> 04:55.448
This is pretty good!

04:55.448 --> 04:57.473
Oh, it's Kurumi's.

04:58.351 --> 05:01.548
Kurumi's lunch is always delicious!

05:04.991 --> 05:05.292
It's omega-delicious!

05:05.292 --> 05:07.060
It's omega-delicious!

05:07.060 --> 05:09.362
