05:25.445 --> 05:26.606
Grin!

05:29.482 --> 05:31.576
What a beautiful day.

05:32.752 --> 05:34.652
What is that?

05:36.489 --> 05:39.059
So here you are, Inugami.

05:39.059 --> 05:40.193
Momose.

05:40.193 --> 05:45.098
When I was on my way here, I heard that some
knucklehead forgot to buy lunch today.

05:45.098 --> 05:46.433
Excuse me for being a knucklehead.

05:46.433 --> 05:47.834
