10:15.802 --> 10:16.669
Hello.

10:16.669 --> 10:16.703
That's a fox!

10:16.703 --> 10:18.204
That's a fox!

10:18.204 --> 10:20.206
No matter how you look at it,
I'm a raccoon-dog, yansu!

10:20.206 --> 10:20.373
No matter how you look at it,
