12:35.508 --> 12:36.009
Do it! Do it! Turn into something!

12:36.009 --> 12:36.743
Do it! Do it! Turn into something!

12:36.743 --> 12:38.575
Well then...

12:40.046 --> 12:41.080
I'll turn into YOU!

12:41.080 --> 12:42.215
Me?

12:42.215 --> 12:43.341
Yes!

12:44.417 --> 12:47.387
Raccoon-rac-rac-raccoon-coon!

12:47.387 --> 12:51.824
Turn into to a cute and pretty,
but slightly plain high school girl!

12:52.025 --> 12:53.550
Don't call me plain!

12:58.464 --> 12:59.632
He really transformed!

12:59.632 --> 13:01.367
Maho! I think it's amazing!

13:01.367 --> 13:01.697
Maho! I think it's amazing!

13:02.135 --> 13:04.331
Tada! Now we look just alike!

13:04.537 --> 13:05.672
I'll frickin' kill you!

13:05.672 --> 13:07.340
He looks a lot like you!

13:08.608 --> 13:09.575
HOW?

13:09.575 --> 13:10.877
I can't even tell you two apart.

13:12.845 --> 13:14.404
I hate all of you!

13:15.248 --> 13:16.113
Huh?

13:17.517 --> 13:21.888
The world is turning... My head is splitting...

13:21.888 --> 13:24.090
I swear I'm quitting drinking...

13:24.090 --> 13:25.625
Miss lgarashi.

13:25.625 --> 13:26.292
Oh my gosh!

13:26.292 --> 13:26.926
Oh my gosh!

13:27.894 --> 13:30.263
