13:38.938 --> 13:40.073
All rise!

13:40.606 --> 13:41.140
Hmm?

13:41.140 --> 13:41.240
Hmm?

13:41.240 --> 13:43.109
I'm Miss lgarashi, yansu!

13:43.109 --> 13:43.910
WHAAAAT?!

13:43.910 --> 13:44.143
WHAAAAT?!

13:44.143 --> 13:49.716
